[[Open This|People Perspective]]

---

The people perspective serves as a bridge between technology and business, accelerating the cloud journey to help organizations more rapidly evolve to a culture of continuous growth and learning, where change becomes business-as-normal.

In addition to culture, the focus is on organizational structure, leadership, and workforce. This perspective comprises seven capabilities shown in the following figure. 

<h2 style="color: #d67568;">Common Stakeholders</h2>

* Chief Information Officer [[CIO]]
* Chief Operations Officer [[COO]]
* Chief Technology Officer [[CTO]]
* cloud director
* crossfunctional and enterprise-wide leaders.

